Modifications
-------------

  LocalLeaf turns the Overleaf editor into an offline macOS application for a
  single user who works in a local folder. The modifications were first
  published in November 2026 at https://github.com/HaiXuan-Lin/LocalLeaf and
  are licensed under the same GNU Affero General Public License, version 3.

  Added by LocalLeaf:
    desktop/                         local backend, packaging, tests, documents
    services/web/modules/desktop/    front-end module for the desktop app
    build.sh, install.sh             build and installation scripts
    NOTICE, CITATION.cff             this notice and citation data

  Changed by LocalLeaf:
    README.md                        replaced by LocalLeaf's README
    .gitignore                       lines appended

  No other file of Overleaf is modified in the source tree. When the app is
  built, the front-end modules listed in
  services/web/modules/desktop/replacements.js are substituted by the versions
  in services/web/modules/desktop/frontend/js/replacements/.

  The git history of this repository shows every change in full.

